ely summarize. I'm curious if there are any specific command line options I should consider or any additional resources available that could assist me with this task. Let's see what I can find!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"I’ll check the stored record tied to your Telegram account and summarize what’s actually there.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0cae4296ee2297370169c291a185bc8191b5fb81fb1f39345e\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_o7Sfe4YOiPa8pSq7ouKz6cVG|fc_0cae4296ee2297370169c291a18f608191b7a312414c090c92","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/user-medical-data-update/scripts/summarize_user_medical_data.py --telegram-user-id 495506013 --format json","workdir":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-patient-agent","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/user-medical-data-update/scripts/summarize_user_medical_data.py --telegram-user-id 495506013 --format json\",\"workdir\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-patient-agent\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1393,"output":119,"cacheRead":9216,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10728,"cost":{"input":0.0034825000000000004,"output":0.0017850000000000001,"cacheRead":0.002304,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0075715}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774358940488}}
